    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「つゆりちゃ～ん、転校生の子だけれど！　あなた、知りあいでしょう？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-santa",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-santa_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「えっ、転校生くん？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「わぁ、ほんとだ。どしたの、風邪でもひいちゃった？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-santa",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-santa_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「まぁいいか。メリークリスマス転校生くん、外は寒かったでしょ。ここにストーブがあるから、おいでおいで～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-santa",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-santa_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「いやぁ、わたしも思いがけず入院が長引いちゃって……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「寒い季節になると、どうもね。体調を崩しがちになっちゃうよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「そうそう、クラスのみんなでクリスマスカードを贈ってくれたでしょ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-santa",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-santa_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「ちゃんと届いてるよ～、みんなと会えずに寂しかったからすごく嬉しかった♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「わたし、お礼にプレゼントしようと思って編み物をしてるんだ。セーターとかマフラーとか……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-santa",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-santa_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「曽根先輩にね、編みかたを教わってるの。先輩、とっても器用なんだよ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "remove_character",
    "id": "center"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 66,
