    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「あはは。あたし入院生活が長いから、手慰みに編んでたら上達しちゃったのだけれど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-santa",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-santa_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「つゆりちゃんに教えながら、こっちも新作を編んでるけれど♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「あたしのギターが寒がってたから、毛糸のカバーをつけてあげるの～☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-santa",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-santa_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-santa",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-santa_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「ギターって寒がるのかなぁ。いや、わたし楽器には詳しくないからわからないけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-santa",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-santa_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「あっ……まだ下手くそだから、編んでる途中のは見ないでね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「不細工で、恥ずかしいもん」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「退院までに上達して、ちゃんと完成させてみんなに配るね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「といっても、年明けになっちゃうかなぁ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-santa",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
